    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a cursed, abandoned building where every shadow hides danger, and every sound could cost you your life. Slendrina is watching you... and she changes with your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cooperative horror survival game for 1\u20134 players, you must search for a way to escape, solve deadly puzzles, and hide from the relentless spirit. But remember: every time, Slendrina behaves differently \u2014 be ready for the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/de06ebcd08c73207597ec0bf993e695d.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dim flashlight beams, creaking floorboards, and breathing behind your back will create tension that won't let go until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/0ada6eaa9f584c0ff74c49a1b810b095.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/0ada6eaa9f584c0ff74c49a1b810b095.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/0ada6eaa9f584c0ff74c49a1b810b095.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/8cf9c8d3c0b7883b4e947bbbb1f809f9.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden paths and explore dark corridors. Your strategy and attentiveness will determine whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/e75ae447409fa6010f75c1ab886082ab.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/e75ae447409fa6010f75c1ab886082ab.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/e75ae447409fa6010f75c1ab886082ab.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/58e2f66474013104ec4c506f841ee638.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is unpredictable. Sometimes she waits, sometimes she strikes without warning. Every session brings a new threat you can't prepare for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/53ca3c68aa14689a61dd2f0e4dd17979.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough introduces new tasks and unexpected changes. What once seemed familiar now becomes dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/fd4f4b0ffc03593041f0179a67045efe.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/fd4f4b0ffc03593041f0179a67045efe.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/fd4f4b0ffc03593041f0179a67045efe.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart Slendrina, or will you remain trapped forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a cursed, abandoned building where every shadow hides danger, and every sound could cost you your life. Slendrina is watching you... and she changes with your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cooperative horror survival game for 1\u20134 players, you must search for a way to escape, solve deadly puzzles, and hide from the relentless spirit. But remember: every time, Slendrina behaves differently \u2014 be ready for the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/de06ebcd08c73207597ec0bf993e695d.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dim flashlight beams, creaking floorboards, and breathing behind your back will create tension that won't let go until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/0ada6eaa9f584c0ff74c49a1b810b095.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/0ada6eaa9f584c0ff74c49a1b810b095.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/0ada6eaa9f584c0ff74c49a1b810b095.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/8cf9c8d3c0b7883b4e947bbbb1f809f9.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden paths and explore dark corridors. Your strategy and attentiveness will determine whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/e75ae447409fa6010f75c1ab886082ab.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/e75ae447409fa6010f75c1ab886082ab.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/e75ae447409fa6010f75c1ab886082ab.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/58e2f66474013104ec4c506f841ee638.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is unpredictable. Sometimes she waits, sometimes she strikes without warning. Every session brings a new threat you can't prepare for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/53ca3c68aa14689a61dd2f0e4dd17979.webp?t=1755416810\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough introduces new tasks and unexpected changes. What once seemed familiar now becomes dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/fd4f4b0ffc03593041f0179a67045efe.poster.avif?t=1755416810\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/fd4f4b0ffc03593041f0179a67045efe.webm?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/fd4f4b0ffc03593041f0179a67045efe.mp4?t=1755416810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart Slendrina, or will you remain trapped forever?</p>",
